abstract: >-
  SAW-1 documents an ETQ-101-informed generative music chain, the later
  recognition that the lyric "Three beats to two" exactly reproduces the
  ordered dimensional signature (3,2) of a separately authored extra-time
  entanglement proposal, and a Lean-checked coordinate-swap extension relating
  the distinct ordered pairs (2,3) and (3,2). The note distinguishes exact
  pair algebra, creative provenance, bounded cognitive possibilities, and
  unsupported causal claims.
